   "body": "\ud83d\uded1 Requirement: Update the repository-installed compiler alongside the runtime pins\n\nThe Copilot setup still installs gh-aw v0.89.21 (.github/workflows/copilot-setup-steps.yml:26-28), as do the compiler-install steps in .github/workflows/agentics-maintenance.yml, including validation at lines 655-657. Regenerating these workflows in those environments uses the older compiler and can undo the runtime upgrades in this PR. Update the setup-cli pins and version inputs to v1.0.1, and regenerate the maintenance workflow with that version so repository-managed compilation stays aligned.",
